<title>SWEDEN: Investor says ABB stakes enable active ownership.</title>
<headline>Investor says ABB stakes enable active ownership.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish investment company Investor said on Wednesday that its direct and indirect holdings in international engineer ABB would be sufficient for an active ownership.</p>
<p>Investor on Wednesday paid 6.4 billion crowns for 55.6 million shares in ABB AB, engineering group ABB's Swedish parent company, corresponding to 5.9 percent of the capital and 8.0 percent of the votes.</p>
</text>
